# Add the following lines to the existing `config XTENSA_ESP32S3`
# block in hw/xtensa/Kconfig. Activation goes via `select` from the SoC
# (not `default y if XTENSA_ESP32S3` from the device side, which would
# create a Kconfig cycle through `BITBANG_I2C select I2C` and `FT6336U_MOFEI
# depends on I2C`).
#
# Both board peripheral sets are compiled into the single QEMU binary; the
# SoC machine instantiates only the set matching the selected board
# (mofei → SSD1677 + FT6336U; s37uc → UC8253C + CHSC6440). GPSPI2 is shared.
    select ESP32S3_GPSPI2
    select SSI_SD
    select FT6336U_MOFEI
    select SSD1677_GDEQ0426
    select CHSC6440_S37UC
    select UC8253C_S37UC
